{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Jockington\n🐍 A limbless snake monster with a cap and light blue shirt, dark sunglasses, and the typical \"friendly jock\" school look.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"4"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Catti**\nHis girlfriend and best friend, a classmate of Kris and Susie in Alphys's classroom — they met right there. Jockington is one of the few Hometown characters who treats her with complete normalcy despite her unconventional appearance (half cat, half fish monster).","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Kris and Susie**\nHe openly supports their friendship with Catti, though he seriously warns he won't tolerate her getting hurt from hanging out with them — the same protective caution he applies, to a lesser degree, to Noelle.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Noelle**\nTeammate on the high school cross country team; one of Noelle's few social connections outside Kris, Susie, and her own family, and one that stays largely friction-free throughout the whole game.","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Catti_overworld.webp","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":127,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_static.png","x":420,"y":-470,"width":92,"height":179},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Noelle_overworld.png","x":420,"y":10,"width":90,"height":180},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Jockington_overworld.webp","x":-67,"y":-290,"width":155,"height":189},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Why does his part of the Prophecy come true so literally?**\nIt's the only prophetic line in the whole game that comes true to the letter and without ambiguity — possibly a deliberate joke by Toby Fox, purposely choosing the fragment with the least possible narrative weight to show that the Prophecy, taken literally, can be as trivial as applying to a teenager with no real role in the plot.","x":-680,"y":125,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"3"}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_catti_krissusie","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_noelle_catti","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"}]}